      en: ["Situated around the Pungwe River estuary near the city of Beira.", "Focused on protecting and rehabilitating critical coastal mangrove forests.", "The mangroves act as essential nurseries for the local prawn fishing industry.", "Provides a vital natural buffer against severe cyclonic storm surges.", "Aims to balance heavy industrial port activity with ecological preservation.", "Supports the livelihoods of numerous local artisanal fishing communities."]
