      en: ["Located in the fertile Limpopo River valley in Gaza Province.", "Teaches kids about large-scale farming and irrigation.", "Visitors can see how staple foods like rice and maize are grown.", "Shows how water is pumped from the river to dry farm fields.", "A great place to learn about the importance of healthy soil.", "Helps kids understand where the food in local markets comes from."]
